  preBlackLines:
  - "Son\u2026 you must come back safely"
  - "Why\u2026 why must you do this to us\u2026?"
  - "Let me go\u2014let me go\u2014let me go\u2014!"
  - och...Who am I? Where is this place?
  - "Go home\u2026 Mom?"
  oldmanLines:
  - "Hahaha\u2026 there are no living souls here. How could you ever go home? Hahaha\u2026"
  heroLines:
  - "I\u2026 am I\u2026 dead?"
  oldmanFinalLines:
  - "These chains are forged from the hardest steel. And the people here\u2026 "
  - their strength has been stripped away by sorcery.
  - " You can only use it if the one above allows it\u2014don\u2019t waste your effort."
  - "But you\u2026"
  - " you\u2019re the only one here still conscious."
  - " I\u2019ll give you a hand."
